<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>SecureLocal | B'izza Woodfire Pizza & Co.</title><meta name="theme-color" content="#c2410c"><link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns=%27http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%27 viewBox=%270 0 100 100%27%3E%3Ctext y=%27.9em%27 font-size=%2790%27%3E🍕%3C/text%3E%3C/svg%3E"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css"><script src="/js/theme.js"></script><script src="/js/app.js" defer></script></head><body><%- include('partials/nav',{user,csrfToken}) %><main class="container"><section class="hero"><div><p class="eyebrow">B'IZZA WOODFIRE PIZZA & CO.</p><h1>Welcome to <span>SecureLocal</span></h1><p class="lead">A safer, simpler way to manage local pizza orders, customer accounts and security — served hot. 🔥</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/menu">🍕 View pizza menu</a><% if (!user) { %><a class="button secondary" href="/register">Create account</a><% } else { %><a class="button secondary" href="/dashboard">Open dashboard</a><% } %></div><div class="badges"><span class="badge">🔐 bcrypt passwords</span><span class="badge">📱 Optional MFA</span><span class="badge">🧾 Audit trail</span><span class="badge">🛡️ AES-256 encryption</span></div></div><div class="hero-art"><p class="hint" style="position:absolute;bottom:0">✨ tap the pizza</p><span class="ember"></span><span class="ember"></span><span class="ember"></span><span class="ember"></span><span class="ember"></span><span class="ember"></span><svg class="pizza" viewBox="0 0 200 200" role="img" aria-label="Woodfire pizza"><g class="spin"><circle cx="100" cy="100" r="92" fill="#d9822b"/><circle cx="100" cy="100" r="92" fill="none" stroke="#b45f1a" stroke-width="3" stroke-dasharray="3 7"/><circle cx="100" cy="100" r="78" fill="#dc2626"/><circle cx="100" cy="100" r="74" fill="#fcd34d"/><g fill="#fef3c7" opacity=".7"><circle cx="70" cy="60" r="10"/><circle cx="130" cy="140" r="12"/><circle cx="140" cy="70" r="8"/><circle cx="60" cy="135" r="9"/></g><g fill="#b91c1c" stroke="#7f1d1d" stroke-width="1.5"><circle cx="100" cy="55" r="12"/><circle cx="145" cy="95" r="11"/><circle cx="125" cy="145" r="12"/><circle cx="72" cy="140" r="11"/><circle cx="55" cy="90" r="12"/><circle cx="100" cy="100" r="10"/></g><g fill="#3f7d20"><path d="M82 82c8-8 16-2 14 6-6 6-14 4-14-6Z"/><path d="M118 112c8-8 16-2 14 6-6 6-14 4-14-6Z"/><path d="M108 70c6-6 12-1 10 5-5 4-11 3-10-5Z"/></g><g stroke="#92400e" stroke-width="1.4" opacity=".55"><path d="M100 26v148M26 100h148M48 48l104 104M152 48 48 152"/></g></g></svg></div></section><div class="marquee" aria-hidden="true"><div class="track"><span>🔥 Fired in 90 seconds</span><span>🔐 MFA protected</span><span>🧀 Extra cheese energy</span><span>🧾 Tamper-evident audit logs</span><span>🍕 Woodfire crust</span><span>🛡️ AES-256 encrypted orders</span></div></div><section class="grid three"><article class="card"><div class="icon">🔒</div><h2>Secure accounts</h2><p>bcrypt password hashing, login lockout, session protection and optional TOTP MFA.</p></article><article class="card"><div class="icon green">🛵</div><h2>Safer ordering</h2><p>Validated orders, parameterized database queries and encrypted contact information.</p></article><article class="card"><div class="icon blue">👀</div><h2>Security visibility</h2><p>Role-based access, incident reporting and tamper-evident audit events.</p></article></section><h2 class="section-title">Build your dream pizza 🎨</h2><p class="section-sub">Tap toppings and watch them land on the pie. Totally free to play with.</p><section class="panel builder"><div class="builder-art"><svg id="bsvg" viewBox="0 0 200 200" role="img" aria-label="Pizza builder"><circle cx="100" cy="100" r="94" fill="#d9822b"/><circle cx="100" cy="100" r="94" fill="none" stroke="#b45f1a" stroke-width="3" stroke-dasharray="3 7"/><circle cx="100" cy="100" r="80" fill="#dc2626"/><circle cx="100" cy="100" r="76" fill="#fcd34d"/><g id="bTops"></g></svg></div><div><p class="eyebrow">TRY IT</p><h2>What's on your pie?</h2><div class="chips"><button type="button" class="chip" data-top="🍅" data-name="Tomato">🍅 Tomato</button><button type="button" class="chip" data-top="🍄" data-name="Mushroom">🍄 Mushroom</button><button type="button" class="chip" data-top="🫒" data-name="Olive">🫒 Olive</button><button type="button" class="chip" data-top="🌶️" data-name="Chili">🌶️ Chili</button><button type="button" class="chip" data-top="🌿" data-name="Basil">🌿 Basil</button><button type="button" class="chip" data-top="🧀" data-name="Cheese">🧀 Cheese</button><button type="button" class="chip" data-top="🍍" data-name="Pineapple">🍍 Pineapple</button></div><div class="live-total"><span id="bName">Plain Dough Dream</span><b id="bPrice">₱249</b></div><div class="actions"><button type="button" class="button secondary" id="bShuffle">🎲 Surprise me</button><button type="button" class="button secondary" id="bClear">Clear</button><a class="button" href="/menu">Order a real one →</a></div></div></section>
